<title>SLOVENIA: Slovenia March trade deficit widens to $154.8 mln.</title>
<headline>Slovenia March trade deficit widens to $154.8 mln.</headline>
<dateline>LJUBLJANA 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Statistical Office of Slovenia reported the following economic details on Tuesday.</p>
<p>SLOVENIA TRADE (in millions of dollars)</p>
<p>				    March   Feb   March 96</p>
<p>    Trade balance	    -154.8   -95.7  -134.4</p>
<p>    Exports		     669.8   636.0   730.4</p>
<p>    Imports		     824.7   731.7   864.8</p>
<p>NOTE: Differences due to rounding. -- Ljubljana newsroom, 386-61-125-8439</p>
